# Required, not hygiene (§10): the build context is the project directory,
# which also holds nag.env (the VAPID private key) and data/ (the database).
# A bare COPY . . would bake both into the cached builder layer.
nag.env
data/
config/
*.db*
.git/
*.md
reminder-theme-preview.html
reminder-datetime-picker.html
docs/
.claude/
